cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, cite the repository; the data carries its own attribution, listed below and in data/nigeria/DATA.md."
title: "Monthly Staple Price Alerts for North-East Nigeria"
abstract: >-
  A monthly early warning benchmark for staple food prices in Borno, Yobe and Adamawa, Nigeria.
  Three rules forecast next month's price change and are turned into alerts at a threshold
  calibrated on twelve months and frozen for the twelve after, compared on three expanding
  folds at a ten percent false alarm target.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Electric97599/ai4e-price-alerts"
